@startuml
actor User
participant "Mobile App\n(React Native)" as MobileApp
participant "Chat API\n(Cloud Run)" as ChatAPI
participant "Voice-to-Text\nService" as VTT
participant "LLM (Gemini)" as LLM
participant "Text-to-Speech\nService" as TTS
database "Cloud Storage\n(Audio Files Bucket)" as AudioBucket
database "Firestore / Cloud Spanner\n(Conversations Collection)" as ConvDB

User -> MobileApp: Selects Theme
MobileApp -> MobileApp: Displays Initial Question
User -> MobileApp: Initiates Voice Recording
MobileApp -> MobileApp: Records Audio
MobileApp -> ChatAPI: Sends User ID, Conversation ID, Audio Data
ChatAPI -> VTT: Sends Audio Data
VTT --> ChatAPI: Returns Text
ChatAPI -> LLM: Sends User ID, Conversation ID, Text
LLM --> ChatAPI: Returns Text Response
ChatAPI -> TTS: Sends Text Response
TTS --> ChatAPI: Returns Audio File Link
ChatAPI -> AudioBucket: Stores Audio Data
AudioBucket --> ChatAPI: Returns Audio Storage URL
ChatAPI -> ConvDB: Stores Conversation Turn (User Text, LLM Text, Audio URL)
ConvDB --> ChatAPI: Acknowledgment
ChatAPI -> MobileApp: Sends Audio File Link
MobileApp -> MobileApp: Plays Audio from Link

@enduml